#: desktop.cc:745
msgid ""
"Could not logout properly.\n"
"The session manager cannot be contacted. You can try to force a shutdown by "
"pressing Ctrl+Alt+Backspace. Note, however, that your current session will "
"not be saved with a forced shutdown."
msgstr ""
"Non se puido saír apropiadamente.\n"
"Non se pode contactar co xestor de sesións. Pode forza-la saída premendo "
"ó mesmo tempo as teclas CTRL, SHIFT e BORRAR. Teña en conta que a sesión "
"actual non será gardada cunha saída forzada."

